===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*leǵ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|colleccioun}}, {{m|enm|collection}}, from {{der|en|fro|collection}}, from {{der|en|la|collēctiō|collēctiō, collēctiōnem}}, from {{m|la|collēctus}}, from {{m|la|colligō||collect together}}, composed of {{prefix|la|con|legō|gloss2=bring together, gather, collect|nocat=1}}, ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*leǵ-||to gather, collect}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|collect|ion}}.

